 "criteria": {
  "metric": "SemEval 2013 DDI standard: micro-averaged F1 over the four positive classes mechanism, effect, advise, int (sklearn f1_score labels [1, 2, 3, 4], average micro) on test_sentence 5-class argmax predictions",
  "models": "b2sentence and b2mixed for biomedbert, bertbase (seeds 42, 1, 2, 3, 4) and biobert (seed 42 only); also the 20 panel checkpoints (test_sentence) as a secondary table",
  "aggregation": "per seed, then mean, SD (ddof 1), min and max over seeds; sentence-cluster bootstrap 95% interval for each seed (1000, seed 42)",
  "official_set_bound": "a second column treats the 2906 official test pairs that the repository does not score (entity types brand and group) as predicted false, which gives the score these predictions would receive on the 5716-pair official set; it is a lower bound for a model that scored those pairs, not an estimate",
  "published": "Gu et al. 2021 (ACM HEALTH, arXiv 2007.15779) Table 6: PubMedBERT 82.36, BioBERT 80.88, BERT uncased 80.04, micro F1, BLURB DDI test 5716 pairs; the comparison is stated as not like-for-like (different train split, entity types, preprocessing)"
